:====
# StyleSheet slots resolve statically in markup style declarations and read late-bound values:
# without a provider the style-sheet's default record supplies initial values, installing a
# provider record changes the subtree's computed values, and slot writes propagate on the next
# settle, including through inherited flow-through aliasing.

/core/style
/core/style-debug
/core/markup
/core/tests/support/markup-fixtures

