;====
:====
# A style sheet derived from another (`• Name is Base for tags`) overrides slots of its base by
# restating them with a value, and registers under its own name as a record of the base's slots:
# providing it changes the subtree's values, and a sheet derived from a derived one keeps the
# overrides above it. A class that uses a derived sheet resolves slots against the sheet its family
# derives from, so using both names one sheet.

