# A style value that reads StyleSheet slots inside an expression, a slot given alone to a rule that
# declares what it takes, and a line of a sheet's rule that computes with the sheet's slots all
# take their values from the subtree's effective record of the sheet, each worked out once per
# record and kept until a slot of the record is written. A derived sheet holds every slot whose
# value reads another, so `doubled` follows `bright` in DarkTheme.

