;====
:====
# A family's members are layers of its rules: the rules that apply are those of the active member,
# each name taken from the nearest sheet up its chain that writes it. DarkTheme restates "glow" and
# adds "shine", ContrastTheme takes both from DarkTheme and restates "Tag", and a rule a rule
# applies after its name follows the active member too.

